            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[## EdgeSlider 1.5

- Simpler menu bar panel: one page with Sensitivity, Haptic Feedback, Swap Sides, Quick Mute, Switch Output and Open at Login. The separate Settings page is gone.
- Only one copy of EdgeSlider can run at a time. Opening it again no longer starts a second one.
]]></description>
